[{"code":"unknown_exports_mode","severity":"error","span":{"file":"platform/beni.json","start":{"line":1,"col":1},"end":{"line":1,"col":1}},"title":"UNKNOWN EXPORTS MODE","message":"This platform declares `\"exports\": \"names\"`, which the compiler does not know.\n\nThe one mode is `\"program\"`: the entry file then exports what `run(main)`\nreturns — its `default`, and each name the app's `beni.json` lists under\n`\"exports\"` (`docs/design/boundary.md` §5.2)."}]
